      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGEND:\n■ Green = entry/exit (GGUF source, final output)\n■ Blue = processing (bake, pack, serve, inference)\n■ Purple = geo addressing + codec (inside FIELD)\n■ Orange/Yellow = scale system + loops (continuous, enter anywhere)\n■ Red = ghost/bond/residual (hyperbolic dimension)\n■ Green dashed = infrastructure (shared across all layers)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LEGEND:\n■ Green = entry/exit (GGUF source, final output)\n■ Blue = processing (bake, pack, serve, inference)\n■ Purple = geo addressing + codec (inside FIELD)\n■ Orange/Yellow = scale system + loops (continuous, enter anywhere)\n■ Red = ghost/bond/residual (hyperbolic dimension)\n■ Green dashed = infrastructure (shared across all layers)",
